Q.23 Restyle the resume page with a proper font pairing and colour palette.
# Professional Resume Page

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Professional student resume and portfolio">
    <title>My Professional Resume</title>

    <!-- Font pairing: Poppins + Open Sans -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Open+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Poppins:wght@500;600;700&display=swap"
          rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        /* Colour palette
           Navy: #17324D
           Blue: #2878A5
           Background: #F3F6FA
           Text: #263445
           White: #FFFFFF
        */

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Open Sans', sans-serif;
            background-color: #F3F6FA;
            color: #263445;
            line-height: 1.7;
            padding: 40px 16px;
        }

        .resume {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: auto;
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(23, 50, 77, 0.10);
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #17324D;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            padding: 40px;
            border-bottom: 5px solid #2878A5;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            font-size: 34px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .header h2 {
            color: #A9D9F2;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .contact {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #E3EDF5;
            overflow-wrap: anywhere;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 35px 40px;
        }

        section {
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        section h2 {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            color: #17324D;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            padding-bottom: 7px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #DCE8F0;
            position: relative;
        }

        section h2::after {
            content: "";
            display: block;
            width: 65px;
            height: 3px;
            background-color: #2878A5;
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -2px;
            left: 0;
        }

        p, li {
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .item {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .item h3 {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #2878A5;
            margin-bottom: 3px;
        }

        .date {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #68798A;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 22px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .skills {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 9px;
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .skills li {
            background-color: #EAF3F9;
            color: #17324D;
            border: 1px solid #D4E6F1;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 18px;
            background-color: #F7F9FC;
            color: #68798A;
            font-size: 12px;
            border-top: 1px solid #E3EAF0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            body {
                padding: 15px 10px;
            }

            .header {
                padding: 28px 22px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 27px;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 25px 22px;
            }
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background: white;
                padding: 0;
            }

            .resume {
                box-shadow: none;
                border-radius: 0;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <main class="resume">

        <header class="header">
            <h1>Your Name</h1>
            <h2>Student | Aspiring Web Developer</h2>
            <p class="contact">
                your.email@example.com |
                +91 98765 43210 |
                Your City, India
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="content">

            <section>
                <h2>Professional Summary</h2>
                <p>
                    Motivated student interested in web development and
                    technology. Eager to learn new skills, solve problems,
                    and contribute to meaningful projects.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Education</h2>
                <div class="item">
                    <h3>Your Degree / Course</h3>
                    <p>Your College Name</p>
                    <p class="date">2026 – Present</p>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <h3>Class 12th</h3>
                    <p>Your School Name</p>
                    <p class="date">Year of Completion: 2026</p>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Technical Skills</h2>
                <ul class="skills">
                    <li>HTML5</li>
                    <li>CSS3</li>
                    <li>JavaScript</li>
                    <li>Git & GitHub</li>
                    <li>VS Code</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Projects</h2>
                <div class="item">
                    <h3>Personal Portfolio Website</h3>
                    <p>
                        Created a responsive portfolio page using HTML
                        and CSS to present personal details, skills,
                        education, and projects.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="item">
                    <h3>Student Registration Form</h3>
                    <p>
                        Designed a structured form using HTML input
                        elements and appropriate labels.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section